  "details": "1. Variables Window is rather big than nodes. Sometimes it hides too much area.\nSo I propose adding a toggle button on the toolbar to toggle visibility of Variables Window.\n2. Variables Window is more back than MiniMap in layering order. If thinking about editing operation, It will be frustrating to block Variables Window by Minimap.\nSo I propose bring Variables Window front of Minimap.\nVersion: VRCSDK-UDON-2020.06.04.14.15_Closed_Community_Test",
